<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - KRUX</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* ---------- :root strict color system ---------- */
        :root {
            --color-bg-primary: #F0EFE6;
            --color-bg-secondary: #EAEAEA;
            --color-stone: #C6C9D2;
            --color-warm: #DCCFC1;
            --color-taupe: #BBAEA8;
            --color-charcoal: #393831;
            --shadow-sm: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03), 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
            --shadow-md: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);
            --shadow-hover: 0 20px 32px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
            --transition-smooth: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.4, 1.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, .section-title {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 32px;
        }

        /* Page Header */
        .page-header.editable-section[data-section="136"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0 32px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        h1.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="137"] {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        h1.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="137"]::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -12px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 80px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--color-charcoal);
        }
        p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="138"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            opacity: 0.7;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 1rem auto 0;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .about-hero.editable-section[data-section="139"] {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 48px;
            margin: 48px 0 64px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .hero-image-container {
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        .hero-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }
        .hero-image-container:hover .hero-image {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }
        .hero-content.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="140"] h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="141"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
        }
        .hero-content p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="142"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        .highlight-text.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="143"] {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--color-charcoal);
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Mission & Values Section */
        .mission-values.editable-section[data-section="144"] {
            background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 48px 32px;
            margin: 64px 0;
        }
        .mission-values h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="145"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        .value-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="146"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .value-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .value-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="147"] {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .value-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="148"] {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        .mission-statement.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="149"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px;
            background: var(--color-bg-primary);
            border-radius: 20px;
        }
        .mission-statement h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .mission-statement p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Craftsmanship Section */
        .craftsmanship.editable-section[data-section="152"] {
            margin: 64px 0;
        }
        .craftsmanship h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="153"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .craftsmanship-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 48px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .craftsmanship-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="154"] h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="155"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .craftsmanship-text p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="156"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        .craftsmanship-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 32px;
        }
        .stat-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="157"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 16px;
        }
        .stat-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="158"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
        }
        .stat-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="159"] {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-top: 8px;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .craftsmanship-image {
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        .craftsmanship-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* Timeline Section */
        .timeline-section.editable-section[data-section="160"] {
            margin: 64px 0;
        }
        .timeline-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="161"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--color-stone);
        }
        .timeline-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="162"] {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            position: relative;
            width: 45%;
        }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: 0;
        }
        .timeline-content {
            background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .timeline-year.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="163"] {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-charcoal);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .timeline-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="164"] {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .timeline-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="165"] {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background: var(--color-charcoal);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 28px;
        }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before {
            right: -42px;
        }
        .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
            left: -42px;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section.editable-section[data-section="166"] {
            margin: 64px 0;
        }
        .team-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="167"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }
        .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="168"] {
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 24px;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
        }
        .team-member:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
        }
        .team-member-image {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }
        .team-member-name.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="169"] {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .team-member-role.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="170"] {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--color-taupe);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .team-member-bio.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="171"] {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Commitment Section */
        .commitment.editable-section[data-section="172"] {
            background: var(--color-charcoal);
            color: var(--color-bg-primary);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 64px 48px;
            margin: 64px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="173"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        }
        .commitment p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="174"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 48px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .commitment-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }
        .commitment-stat.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="175"] {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .commitment-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="176"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-warm);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .commitment-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="177"] {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1200px) {
            .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .about-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
            .craftsmanship-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
            .values-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .commitment-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .timeline::before { left: 30px; }
            .timeline-item { width: calc(100% - 60px); margin-left: 60px !important; margin-right: 0 !important; }
            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before, .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before { left: -38px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container { padding: 0 24px; }
            .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .team-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; }
            .commitment-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
            h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .mission-values { padding: 32px 24px; }
            .commitment { padding: 48px 32px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .container { padding: 0 20px; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<main>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Page Header -->
        <div class="page-header editable-section" data-section="136">
            <h1 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="137" data-text="92">Our Story</h1>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="138" data-text="93">Redefining streetwear with refined elegance and uncompromising quality</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="about-hero editable-section" data-section="139">
            <div class="hero-image-container">
                <img class="hero-image editable-image" data-image="70" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-b413da4baf72?w=800&auto=format" alt="KRUX Studio">
            </div>
            <div class="hero-content editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="140">
                <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="141" data-text="94">Founded in 2020</h2>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="142" data-text="95">KRUX was born from a vision to bridge the gap between urban streetwear and refined elegance. What began as a small atelier in Brooklyn has grown into a brand recognized for its commitment to quality, craftsmanship, and timeless design.</p>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="143" data-text="96">Our founder, Marcus Chen, envisioned a brand that would honor the authenticity of street culture while embracing the sophistication of luxury fashion. Today, KRUX continues to push boundaries, creating pieces that are as functional as they are beautiful.</p>
                <p class="highlight-text editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="144" data-text="97">"Fashion should feel effortless. Every piece we create is designed to be worn, lived in, and loved for years to come." — Marcus Chen, Founder</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mission & Values Section -->
        <div class="mission-values editable-section" data-section="145">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="146" data-text="98">Our Philosophy</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <!-- Value 1 -->
                <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="147">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-gem editable-icon" data-icon="70" data-default-class="fas fa-gem"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="148" data-text="99">Uncompromising Quality</h3>
                    <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="149" data-text="100">We source only the finest materials from ethical suppliers. Every garment undergoes rigorous quality checks before reaching your hands.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Value 2 -->
                <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="150">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-hand-sparkles editable-icon" data-icon="71" data-default-class="fas fa-hand-sparkles"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="151" data-text="101">Artisan Craftsmanship</h3>
                    <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="152" data-text="102">Each piece is crafted with precision by skilled artisans who take pride in their work, ensuring exceptional attention to detail.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Value 3 -->
                <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="153">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-leaf editable-icon" data-icon="72" data-default-class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="154" data-text="103">Sustainable Practices</h3>
                    <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="155" data-text="104">We're committed to reducing our environmental impact through sustainable materials and ethical manufacturing processes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-statement editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="156">
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="157" data-text="105">Our Mission</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="158" data-text="106">To create timeless streetwear that empowers individuals to express themselves authentically, while championing sustainability and craftsmanship in everything we do.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Craftsmanship Section -->
        <div class="craftsmanship editable-section" data-section="159">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="160" data-text="107">The Art of Craftsmanship</h2>
            <div class="craftsmanship-content">
                <div class="craftsmanship-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="161">
                    <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="162" data-text="108">Masterful Precision</h3>
                    <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="163" data-text="109">Every KRUX garment begins with a vision. Our designers sketch, prototype, and refine each piece until it meets our exacting standards. From there, our skilled artisans bring these designs to life using time-honored techniques.</p>
                    <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="164" data-text="110">We believe that true quality is found in the details. That's why we obsess over every stitch, every seam, and every finish. The result is clothing that not only looks exceptional but stands the test of time.</p>
                    <div class="craftsmanship-stats">
                        <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="165">
                            <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="166" data-text="111">47</div>
                            <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="167" data-text="112">Quality Checks</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="168">
                            <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="169" data-text="113">100+</div>
                            <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="170" data-text="114">Hours Per Collection</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="171">
                            <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="172" data-text="115">95%</div>
                            <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="173" data-text="116">Sustainable Materials</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="craftsmanship-image">
                    <img class="craftsmanship-img editable-image" data-image="71" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1539109136881-3be0616acf4b?w=800&auto=format" alt="Craftsmanship process">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline Section -->
        <div class="timeline-section editable-section" data-section="174">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="175" data-text="117">Our Journey</h2>
            <div class="timeline">
                <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
                <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="176">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="177" data-text="118">2020</div>
                        <h3 class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="178" data-text="119">The Beginning</h3>
                        <p class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="179" data-text="120">KRUX is founded in Brooklyn, New York, with a small collection of 12 pieces and a commitment to quality over quantity.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
                <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="180">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="181" data-text="121">2021</div>
                        <h3 class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="182" data-text="122">First Flagship</h3>
                        <p class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="183" data-text="123">We open our first flagship store in SoHo, creating a space where customers can experience the brand's aesthetic firsthand.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Timeline Item 3 -->
                <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="184">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="185" data-text="124">2022</div>
                        <h3 class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="186" data-text="125">Sustainable Shift</h3>
                        <p class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="187" data-text="126">We transition to 95% sustainable materials across our entire collection, reinforcing our commitment to the planet.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
                <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="188">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="189" data-text="127">2023</div>
                        <h3 class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="190" data-text="128">Global Recognition</h3>
                        <p class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="191" data-text="129">KRUX gains international recognition, with our collections featured in leading fashion publications worldwide.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
